{"v":4,"catch":"穿過田野！ 奪取敵人的能量！！","desc":"《VOLFIED》是TAITO於1989年發行的一款畫線動作解謎遊戲。\n駕駛 Monotros 使用船上的雷射將外星人趕出家園，奪回被佔領的領土。\n重奪 80% 的關卡即可獲勝，但要小心，當你的屏障關閉時，敵人不會接觸到你的船隻或不完整的線路。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-03-28","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f8f0ab608222dee19a48a508f6b360ef75ca40497bf24569e022b09b0375418.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e7cf41e1325cccdcf1d333051f943d3b5e2f0e4417fae13c72037c2a503d4c9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d72f2b94bc8d450736d6812fd7320a3ece3dfeecf2c0d5bafbc78322ff26744b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54cd1eea824825d58b5b5f483727b29534b30022605d7f917d9e0bdef14befee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8a3a606ad93e634fdc0a32deda026ba651e5fc393287dfdd0e1e16238da009e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c8fd572d7ed25af33fde2f769ceb8c99931db8fbbf7cacace180e33f3f0c7a3b.jpg"],"titleId":"01008f901de0c000","dlc":[]}